  <!-- EN: cerebral hypoxia -->
  <BrainDamage_Hypoxia.label>cerebral hypoxia</BrainDamage_Hypoxia.label>
  <!-- EN: Oxygen deprivation damages the brain and can leave lasting disabilities. Complete unprotected deprivation can kill in about 1.5 game hours; the final stage is terminal. Restore oxygen delivery to permit healing. Artificial coma halves new injury but does not treat its cause or stop organ-failure timers. -->
  <BrainDamage_Hypoxia.description>Oxygen deprivation damages the brain and can leave lasting disabilities. Complete unprotected deprivation can kill in about 1.5 game hours; the final stage is terminal. Restore oxygen delivery to permit healing. Artificial coma halves new injury but does not treat its cause or stop organ-failure timers.</BrainDamage_Hypoxia.description>
